{"seq":1,"slug":"drift-detection-remediation","title":"漂移检测与自动修复：维护集群配置完整性的系统方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gitops-declarative-delivery/operations/drift-detection-remediation","wordCount":1045,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"漂移检测与自动修复-维护集群配置完整性的系统方法\">漂移检测与自动修复：维护集群配置完整性的系统方法</h1><p>漂移（Drift）是 GitOps 系统的主要运营挑战。即使有持续调谐器在运行，实际环境中漂移仍然频繁发生——紧急操作、自动化工具的干预、Kubernetes 版本升级后的字段变化，都会引入漂移。系统性地处理漂移需要：明确哪些漂移应该自动修复、哪些应该豁免、哪些需要告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>漂移（Drift）</td>\n<td>集群实际状态与 Git 中声明的期望状态之间的偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>selfHeal</td>\n<td>Argo CD 的自动修复标志，检测到漂移后立即触发同步将集群恢复到期望状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ignoreDifferences</td>\n<td>Argo CD 的豁免配置，指定特定字段的漂移不触发 OutOfSync 状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>prune</td>\n<td>删除 Git 中已移除但集群中仍存在的资源的操作，防止&quot;孤儿资源&quot;积累</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Server-Side Apply</td>\n<td>Kubernetes 1.18+ 的 apply 机制，通过字段所有权（field ownership）解决多控制器冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OutOfSync</td>\n<td>Argo CD 应用状态，表示集群实际状态与 Git 期望状态不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预期漂移</td>\n<td>由已知自动化工具（HPA、Istio sidecar 注入等）引发的、应被豁免的漂移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"漂移的分类模型\">漂移的分类模型</h2><p>不是所有的漂移都是&quot;坏事&quot;。在处理漂移前，需要建立清晰的分类模型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    D[检测到漂移] --&gt; C1{来源是否可识别？}&#10;    C1 --&gt;|已知自动化工具| E1[预期漂移 - 豁免]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|未知来源| C2{是否影响功能？}&#10;    C2 --&gt;|否| E2[良性漂移 - 记录不修复]&#10;    C2 --&gt;|是| C3{是否紧急？}&#10;    C3 --&gt;|否| E3[计划外漂移 - 自动修复]&#10;    C3 --&gt;|是| E4[紧急操作漂移 - 事后补充 Git]\">graph TD\n    D[检测到漂移] --&gt; C1{来源是否可识别？}\n    C1 --&gt;|已知自动化工具| E1[预期漂移 - 豁免]\n    C1 --&gt;|未知来源| C2{是否影响功能？}\n    C2 --&gt;|否| E2[良性漂移 - 记录不修复]\n    C2 --&gt;|是| C3{是否紧急？}\n    C3 --&gt;|否| E3[计划外漂移 - 自动修复]\n    C3 --&gt;|是| E4[紧急操作漂移 - 事后补充 Git]</pre><h3 id=\"预期漂移-应豁免\">预期漂移（应豁免）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>典型示例</th>\n<th>处理策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HPA 副本调整</td>\n<td>Deployment replicas 被 HPA 动态修改</td>\n<td>在 ignoreDifferences 中豁免</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Service Mesh sidecar 注入</td>\n<td>Istio/Linkerd 向 Pod spec 注入 sidecar 容器</td>\n<td>豁免 sidecar 相关字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Admission Webhook</td>\n<td>安全 Webhook 添加 labels/annotations</td>\n<td>豁免系统注入的标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kubernetes 默认值</td>\n<td>API Server 补充的 defaultMode、terminationMessagePath</td>\n<td>豁免系统默认字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证书轮换</td>\n<td>cert-manager 自动更新 TLS Secret</td>\n<td>豁免证书内容字段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"计划外漂移-应修复\">计划外漂移（应修复）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>严重程度</th>\n<th>修复策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手动 kubectl edit/patch</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>selfHeal 自动修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误操作删除资源</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>selfHeal + prune 恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置管理工具冲突</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>统一工具链，消除冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集群升级后字段变化</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>更新 Git 中的配置以匹配新行为</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"argo-cd-的精细化漂移控制\">Argo CD 的精细化漂移控制</h2><h3 id=\"ignoredifferences-豁免特定字段\">ignoreDifferences：豁免特定字段</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: Application&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: payment-service&#10;spec:&#10;  ignoreDifferences:&#10;    # 豁免 HPA 管理的副本数&#10;    - group: apps&#10;      kind: Deployment&#10;      jsonPointers:&#10;        - /spec/replicas&#10;&#10;    # 豁免 Service 的 clusterIP（系统分配）&#10;    - group: &#39;&#39;&#10;      kind: Service&#10;      jsonPointers:&#10;        - /spec/clusterIP&#10;        - /spec/clusterIPs&#10;&#10;    # 豁免 Istio sidecar 注入的容器&#10;    - group: apps&#10;      kind: Deployment&#10;      jqPathExpressions:&#10;        - &#39;.spec.template.spec.containers[] | select(.name == &quot;istio-proxy&quot;)&#39;&#10;        - &#39;.spec.template.spec.initContainers[] | select(.name == &quot;istio-init&quot;)&#39;&#10;&#10;    # 豁免 cert-manager 管理的证书内容&#10;    - group: &#39;&#39;&#10;      kind: Secret&#10;      name: &#39;*-tls&#39; # 匹配所有 -tls 结尾的 Secret&#10;      jsonPointers:&#10;        - /data/tls.crt&#10;        - /data/tls.key\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argoproj.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Application</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ignoreDifferences</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 豁免 HPA 管理的副本数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      jsonPointers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/spec/replicas</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 豁免 Service 的 clusterIP（系统分配）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      jsonPointers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/spec/clusterIP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/spec/clusterIPs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 豁免 Istio sidecar 注入的容器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      jqPathExpressions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.spec.template.spec.containers[] | select(.name == \"istio-proxy\")'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.spec.template.spec.initContainers[] | select(.name == \"istio-init\")'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 豁免 cert-manager 管理的证书内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Secret</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*-tls'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 匹配所有 -tls 结尾的 Secret</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      jsonPointers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/data/tls.crt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/data/tls.key</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"全局-ignoredifferences-配置\">全局 ignoreDifferences 配置</h3><p>不想在每个 Application 重复配置，可以在 <code>argocd-cm</code> ConfigMap 中设置全局豁免：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ConfigMap: argocd-cm&#10;data:&#10;  resource.customizations.ignoreDifferences.apps_Deployment: |&#10;    jqPathExpressions:&#10;    - &#39;.spec.replicas&#39;&#10;&#10;  resource.customizations.ignoreDifferences.admissionregistration.k8s.io_MutatingWebhookConfiguration: |&#10;    jqPathExpressions:&#10;    - &#39;.webhooks[]?.clientConfig.caBundle&#39;&#10;&#10;  # 豁免所有 Service 的 clusterIP&#10;  resource.customizations.ignoreDifferences.core_Service: |&#10;    jsonPointers:&#10;    - /spec/clusterIP&#10;    - /spec/clusterIPs\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ConfigMap: argocd-cm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  resource.customizations.ignoreDifferences.apps_Deployment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    jqPathExpressions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    - '.spec.replicas'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  resource.customizations.ignoreDifferences.admissionregistration.k8s.io_MutatingWebhookConfiguration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    jqPathExpressions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    - '.webhooks[]?.clientConfig.caBundle'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 豁免所有 Service 的 clusterIP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  resource.customizations.ignoreDifferences.core_Service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    jsonPointers:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    - /spec/clusterIP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    - /spec/clusterIPs</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"flux-的漂移处理策略\">Flux 的漂移处理策略</h2><p>Flux 通过 Kustomization 的 <code>force</code> 和 <code>prune</code> 字段控制漂移处理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kustomize.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1&#10;kind: Kustomization&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: payment-service&#10;spec:&#10;  interval: 10m&#10;  prune: true # 删除 Git 中移除的资源（漂移修复的一部分）&#10;  force: false # 不使用 replace（保持 patch 语义）&#10;&#10;&#10;  # Flux 不像 Argo CD 有 ignoreDifferences，&#10;  # 但可以通过 Server-Side Apply 的 field ownership 机制&#10;  # 让 HPA 等控制器&quot;拥有&quot;特定字段\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kustomize.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Kustomization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  prune</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 删除 Git 中移除的资源（漂移修复的一部分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  force</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 不使用 replace（保持 patch 语义）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # Flux 不像 Argo CD 有 ignoreDifferences，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 但可以通过 Server-Side Apply 的 field ownership 机制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 让 HPA 等控制器\"拥有\"特定字段</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Flux 对 HPA 管理字段的处理推荐方式：不在 Git 中的 Deployment 里声明 replicas，让 HPA 完全接管：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 在 Git 中不设置 replicas（让 HPA 控制）&#10;apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: Deployment&#10;spec:&#10;  # 故意不写 replicas，避免与 HPA 冲突&#10;  selector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: payment-service&#10;  template:&#10;    # ...&#10;&#10;---&#10;# HPA 同样在 Git 中管理&#10;apiVersion: autoscaling/v2&#10;kind: HorizontalPodAutoscaler&#10;spec:&#10;  scaleTargetRef:&#10;    apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;    kind: Deployment&#10;    name: payment-service&#10;  minReplicas: 3&#10;  maxReplicas: 20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 Git 中不设置 replicas（让 HPA 控制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 故意不写 replicas，避免与 HPA 冲突</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># HPA 同样在 Git 中管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">autoscaling/v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">HorizontalPodAutoscaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  scaleTargetRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  minReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  maxReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"漂移检测的可观测性\">漂移检测的可观测性</h2><p>检测到漂移但还没修复时，需要可见性：</p>\n<h3 id=\"argo-cd-漂移监控\">Argo CD 漂移监控</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查找所有 OutOfSync 的 Application&#10;kubectl get applications -n argocd \\&#10;  --field-selector=&#39;.status.sync.status=OutOfSync&#39;&#10;&#10;# 或通过 argocd CLI&#10;argocd app list --sync-status=OutOfSync&#10;&#10;# 查看具体 diff（期望 vs 实际）&#10;argocd app diff payment-service\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查找所有 OutOfSync 的 Application</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> applications</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> argocd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --field-selector=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.status.sync.status=OutOfSync'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或通过 argocd CLI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --sync-status=OutOfSync</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看具体 diff（期望 vs 实际）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> payment-service</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置告警（Argo CD Notifications）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ConfigMap: argocd-notifications-cm&#10;apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: ConfigMap&#10;data:&#10;  # 触发器：Application 变为 OutOfSync 时通知&#10;  trigger.on-sync-status-unknown: |&#10;    - description: Application status is &#39;Unknown&#39;&#10;      send:&#10;      - app-sync-status&#10;      when: app.status.sync.status == &#39;OutOfSync&#39;&#10;&#10;  # 通知模板&#10;  template.app-sync-status: |&#10;    message: |&#10;      Application {{.app.metadata.name}} is {{.app.status.sync.status}}.&#10;      Revision: {{.app.status.sync.revision}}.&#10;      Details: {{.context.argocdUrl}}/applications/{{.app.metadata.name}}&#10;&#10;  # Slack 通知配置&#10;  service.slack: |&#10;    token: $slack-token&#10;    username: Argo CD\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ConfigMap: argocd-notifications-cm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ConfigMap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 触发器：Application 变为 OutOfSync 时通知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  trigger.on-sync-status-unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    - description: Application status is 'Unknown'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      send:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      - app-sync-status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      when: app.status.sync.status == 'OutOfSync'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 通知模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template.app-sync-status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    message: |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      Application {{.app.metadata.name}} is {{.app.status.sync.status}}.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      Revision: {{.app.status.sync.revision}}.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      Details: {{.context.argocdUrl}}/applications/{{.app.metadata.name}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # Slack 通知配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  service.slack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    token: $slack-token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    username: Argo CD</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"漂移指标-prometheus\">漂移指标（Prometheus）</h3><p>Argo CD 和 Flux 都暴露 Prometheus 指标：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prometheus\" data-code=\"# Argo CD：OutOfSync 的 Application 数量&#10;argocd_app_info{sync_status=&quot;OutOfSync&quot;}&#10;&#10;# Argo CD：最近同步时间&#10;argocd_app_reconcile_count&#10;&#10;# Flux：调谐失败次数&#10;gotk_reconcile_error_total&#10;&#10;# Flux：调谐持续时间&#10;gotk_reconcile_duration_seconds\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Argo CD：OutOfSync 的 Application 数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>argocd_app_info{sync_status=\"OutOfSync\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Argo CD：最近同步时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>argocd_app_reconcile_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Flux：调谐失败次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gotk_reconcile_error_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Flux：调谐持续时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gotk_reconcile_duration_seconds</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Grafana 告警规则示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Prometheus AlertRule&#10;groups:&#10;  - name: gitops-drift&#10;    rules:&#10;      - alert: ArgoCDApplicationOutOfSync&#10;        expr: argocd_app_info{sync_status=&quot;OutOfSync&quot;} &gt; 0&#10;        for: 10m # 漂移持续 10 分钟后告警（给自动修复时间）&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: warning&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;Argo CD Application {{ $labels.name }} is OutOfSync&#39;&#10;          description: &#39;Application has been OutOfSync for more than 10 minutes&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: FluxReconciliationFailure&#10;        expr: gotk_reconcile_error_total &gt; 0&#10;        for: 5m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: critical&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;Flux reconciliation failing for {{ $labels.name }}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Prometheus AlertRule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gitops-drift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ArgoCDApplicationOutOfSync</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argocd_app_info{sync_status=\"OutOfSync\"} > 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10m</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 漂移持续 10 分钟后告警（给自动修复时间）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Argo CD Application {{ $labels.name }} is OutOfSync'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Application has been OutOfSync for more than 10 minutes'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FluxReconciliationFailure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gotk_reconcile_error_total > 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Flux reconciliation failing for {{ $labels.name }}'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"紧急操作的-gitops-回溯流程\">紧急操作的 GitOps 回溯流程</h2><p>有时候，运维工程师需要在紧急情况下直接修改集群（比如凌晨 3 点服务挂了），绕过 GitOps 流程。这是可以理解的，但事后必须将紧急操作写回 Git：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 紧急操作（直接修改集群）&#10;kubectl scale deployment payment-service --replicas=10&#10;&#10;# 事后：将集群当前状态导出，写回 Git&#10;kubectl get deployment payment-service -o yaml | \\&#10;  # 去掉系统字段&#10;  yq &#39;del(.metadata.resourceVersion, .metadata.uid, .metadata.creationTimestamp, .status)&#39; \\&#10;  &gt; apps/payment-service/overlays/production/deployment-patch.yaml&#10;&#10;# 提交到 Git&#10;git add apps/payment-service/&#10;git commit -m &quot;fix: emergency scale payment-service to 10 replicas during incident&#10;&#10;Incident: #INC-2026-001&#10;Root cause: DB connection pool exhausted under load&#10;Action taken: Scale replicas from 5 to 10 manually&#10;Follow-up: Review HPA configuration to prevent recurrence&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 紧急操作（直接修改集群）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> scale</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> payment-service</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --replicas=10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 事后：将集群当前状态导出，写回 Git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> payment-service</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yaml</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 去掉系统字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  yq</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'del(.metadata.resourceVersion, .metadata.uid, .metadata.creationTimestamp, .status)'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apps/payment-service/overlays/production/deployment-patch.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 提交到 Git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apps/payment-service/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"fix: emergency scale payment-service to 10 replicas during incident</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Incident: #INC-2026-001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Root cause: DB connection pool exhausted under load</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Action taken: Scale replicas from 5 to 10 manually</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Follow-up: Review HPA configuration to prevent recurrence\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个流程确保了：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>紧急操作被记录在 Git 历史中，有完整的上下文说明</li>\n<li>GitOps 调谐器不会&quot;撤销&quot;这个紧急操作（因为它已经在 Git 中）</li>\n<li>事后审计可以追溯到这次紧急变更</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>漂移检测与修复是 GitOps 运营的核心能力，而非自动化工具能完全消除的问题。有效的漂移治理需要三层机制配合：分类（区分预期漂移与计划外漂移）、豁免（用 <code>ignoreDifferences</code> 防止 HPA/Sidecar 注入等合法变更被误判）、告警（用 Prometheus 指标和 Argo CD Notifications 让漂移在修复前保持可见）。<code>selfHeal + prune</code> 覆盖了大多数计划外漂移的自动修复；但紧急操作引入的漂移需要运维人员事后&quot;回写 Git&quot;，确保 Git 历史中有完整的变更上下文。Server-Side Apply 的字段所有权机制是解决&quot;GitOps 调谐器与其他控制器（HPA）竞争同一字段&quot;问题的根本途径。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>下一步：<a href=\"multi-cluster-fleet\">多集群舰队管理</a> 覆盖 GitOps 在多集群环境中的扩展策略。</em></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"漂移检测与自动修复：维护集群配置完整性的系统方法","id":"漂移检测与自动修复-维护集群配置完整性的系统方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"漂移的分类模型","id":"漂移的分类模型"},{"level":3,"text":"预期漂移（应豁免）","id":"预期漂移-应豁免"},{"level":3,"text":"计划外漂移（应修复）","id":"计划外漂移-应修复"},{"level":2,"text":"Argo CD 的精细化漂移控制","id":"argo-cd-的精细化漂移控制"},{"level":3,"text":"ignoreDifferences：豁免特定字段","id":"ignoredifferences-豁免特定字段"},{"level":3,"text":"全局 ignoreDifferences 配置","id":"全局-ignoredifferences-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Flux 的漂移处理策略","id":"flux-的漂移处理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"漂移检测的可观测性","id":"漂移检测的可观测性"},{"level":3,"text":"Argo CD 漂移监控","id":"argo-cd-漂移监控"},{"level":3,"text":"漂移指标（Prometheus）","id":"漂移指标-prometheus"},{"level":2,"text":"紧急操作的 GitOps 回溯流程","id":"紧急操作的-gitops-回溯流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GitOps 中的密钥管理：不在 Git 里存明文，但 Git 仍是唯一真相源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gitops-declarative-delivery/patterns/secrets-gitops"},"next":{"title":"多集群舰队管理：GitOps 在大规模集群环境中的扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gitops-declarative-delivery/operations/multi-cluster-fleet"}}